// Disable, enable, delete, admin, password, role, source, and account mutation events.
SailPointISC_Events
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| where IsPrivileged
| project TimeGenerated, EventName, Actor, TargetIdentity, TargetBracketSource, TargetAccount, SourceName, Category, OperationName, ActionName, TechName, Outcome, TriggerInterface, ChangedItem, EventSummary, HostName, TrackingNumber
| order by TimeGenerated desc
| take 200
